wb-cli (0.3.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * FIX: `history get/chart --from/--to` crashed with a cryptic C++ RPC
    error because the string was passed verbatim instead of being converted
    to a Unix timestamp. Now parsed via datetime.fromisoformat(); naive
    datetimes treated as UTC. Bad input raises HISTORY_INVALID_TIMESTAMP
    with a hint showing the expected format.
  * FIX: `snapshot diff` in human mode showed Python dict repr (single-
    quoted keys) in table cells. Nested objects now rendered as JSON.
  * FIX: `job status` reported "inactive" for failed units. systemctl
    is-active exits non-zero with stdout "failed" for failed units; now
    stdout is used unconditionally. Failed jobs correctly show "failed".
  * FIX: `job run` error code was JOB_ALREADY_RUNNING for any systemd-run
    failure (not just duplicates). Renamed to JOB_START_FAILED.
  * FIX: `rules disable/enable` hint for names with multiple dots (e.g.
    my.rule.js) suggested "my" instead of "my.rule". Fixed with
    removesuffix().
  * install-skills.sh: `manual` target now strips frontmatter to
    name+description only instead of verbatim copy with Claude-specific
    fields. No-arg invocation prints clean English help and exits 0.
  * skills/wiren-board: document default credentials (root/wirenboard),
    avahi-resolve and nmap fallbacks, fixed false "pipe→JSON auto" claim.
    Key commands section replaced with pointer to wb-cli --help.
  * skills/wb-scenarios removed.

